==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.}} < {{etyl|la}} {{term|lang=la|sputum||that which is spit out, spittle}} < {{term|lang=la|spuere||to spit}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sputa}}

# {{physiology}} Matter coughed up and [[expectorate]]d from the mouth, composed of [[saliva]] and discharges from the respiratory passages such as [[mucus]], [[phlegm]] or [[pus]].

